      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that makes sense. i'm a bit stuck on the morphophonemic part though. specifically with the word \"kirjan\". it feels like there's a vowel change or some kind of stem alteration happening in there. can you explain the actual mechanics of why the 'a' in 'kirja' becomes 'an' when the suffix is added? like, what's the formal rule for that kind of shift?",
